r['hand'].append('Scan022: a separate horizontal abbreviation bar in the word after expliciter must not be absorbed into an invented full spelling. Two low points near a phi descender are retained without deciding whether they form punctuation. The lower broad hook and sloping connector are reproduced graphically, not reduced to a paired parenthesis.')
